Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 5,0:00:07.25,0:00:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with you?!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.15,0:00:10.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you stop this\Nnonsense already?!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:11.49,0:00:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp just got worked up
Dialogue: 50,0:00:12.46,0:00:15.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because things were\Nmoving too fast, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.13,0:00:17.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's no reason to\Nfight with your own friend,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:17.13,0:00:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,especially when he's hurt!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:18.73,0:00:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you give it some time,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.80,0:00:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure both of you will\Nsee how silly this is.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.70,0:00:26.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gone too far\Nto turn back now.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.24,0:00:27.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.21,0:00:29.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing stopping\Nyou from apologizing
Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.21,0:00:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and talking it\Nover one more time!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.07,0:00:37.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, no turning back.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.14,0:00:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.01,0:00:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp is willing to risk his life to fight\Nme.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:41.88,0:00:43.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's more than just angry.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.95,0:00:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, if just talking it over\Nwas enough to make things right,
Dialogue: 50,0:00:47.29,0:00:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we wouldn'ta come to\Nthis in the first place.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:50.82,0:00:53.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say, so goodnight.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.44,0:00:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:56.56,0:00:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NThink about it!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:57.76,0:01:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said the Franky Family\Ncame here this afternoon, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:01.09,0:01:03.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? So, what are\Nyou trying to say?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.39,0:01:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't let\Nthem off so easy,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they would've have\Nstolen the money
Dialogue: 50,0:01:06.33,0:01:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from us in the first place!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.56,0:01:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's your fault those\Nguys attacked Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.63,0:01:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's just freaking out\N'cause he feels guilty!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:12.04,0:01:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't go blaming me for not\Nkicking their asses hard enough,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you were the one who\Nran off to go shopping!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.16,0:01:19.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What am I 'sposed to cook\Nif I don't have any food?!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:19.44,0:01:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NBoth of you shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.05,0:01:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:22.12,0:01:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThere's been\Nenough fighting already.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:26.08,0:01:27.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhatever\Nhappened, it's over now.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:27.99,0:01:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know but this wouldn't be\Nhappening if it wasn't for him!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.16,0:01:37.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. You're back.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.23,0:01:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were going after Usopp, weren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.13,0:01:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if he was mad, I still wanted to\Ntreat his wounds.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.23,0:01:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he turned me away.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.56,0:01:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He found a place to stay.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.86,0:01:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So at least he\Ncan get some rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.60,0:01:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But do you know what he said to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.09,0:01:55.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said we\Naren't friends now.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.97,0:02:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I should leave him alone\Nand go back to the ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.38,0:02:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just this morning we were\Nall so happy and now what?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.62,0:02:13.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWe lost Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.42,0:02:15.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin's still missing.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.26,0:02:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel like if we\Ndon't do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:21.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the whole crew\Nis gonna fall apart.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.38,0:02:28.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIt's 10 o'clock.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.30,0:02:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp'll be here\Nany second now.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:40.56,0:02:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up! I don't want\Nany of you leaving the ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.76,0:02:45.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:52.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.50,0:02:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.03,0:03:20.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you didn't lose your nerve after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.36,0:03:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how this battle ends,\Nyou can't regret it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.00,0:03:25.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what you asked for.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.70,0:03:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's perfect.\NDon't go easy on me.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't be the underdog this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.73,0:03:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact. I've already figured\Nout a way to defeat you.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.67,0:03:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we stop this?\NUsopp's injuries are pretty bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.60,0:03:41.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you can't stand to watch, then go\Ninside.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.39,0:03:42.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NMake no mistake,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.66,0:03:45.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not like any opponent\Nyou've faced before.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.99,0:03:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been friends a long time.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.90,0:03:50.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know all your powers,\Nall your strengths,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and all of your weaknesses!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.94,0:05:47.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there's something you don't know about\Nme.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.64,0:05:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have 8 thousand\Nmen on my side!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.31,0:05:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't surrender now,\NI'll order them to attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.25,0:05:57.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Why didn't\Nhe tell me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.99,0:05:59.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, just go inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.89,0:06:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna fight, then\Nat least take this seriously!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.92,0:06:05.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp Voodoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.43,0:06:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have razor-sharp needles\Nstuck between all of your teeth!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.69,0:06:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAhh!\NIt hurts just to imagine that!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.01,0:06:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI'm telling you, go inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.42,0:06:15.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got\Nprickly cactus spines.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Under your finger...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.33,0:06:21.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.16,0:06:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.79,0:06:33.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Waaaaah!\NUsopp, please don't die!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.71,0:06:36.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack\NKetchup Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.45,0:06:39.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pity for your enemy?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.12,0:06:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's awful arrogant,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.09,0:06:43.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flash Dial!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now Special Attack: Egg Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.00,0:06:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Again! Again!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Again!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.98,0:06:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It stinks! They're rotten!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.00,0:07:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Would you stop\Nmessing around already?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.19,0:07:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NYou think this is a joke, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.11,0:07:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm dead serious!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.18,0:07:07.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NThis is the way I fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.69,0:07:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careful, that gaping mouth\Nof yours is gonna get burned!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.58,0:07:19.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack Tabasco Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:22.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHot!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.26,0:07:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI wouldn't jump around\Ntoo much if I were you!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.39,0:07:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause the whole\Nbattlefield is Caltrop Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.00,0:07:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.30,0:07:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's controlling the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.73,0:07:37.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy.\NYou can pity me if you want,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.60,0:07:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'm gonna beat you\Nand take the Merry with me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.21,0:07:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I don't care what it takes!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP]\NSpecial Attack! Pepper Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.08,0:07:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sneezes]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.18,0:07:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sneezes]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I know you.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.32,0:08:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I know which attacks\Nare gonna work the best!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.18,0:08:06.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDamn it. This stuff stinks.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.01,0:08:09.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My mouth is burning.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.48,0:08:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it hurts!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna give you\Nan inch, you hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.58,0:08:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack\NShuriken Shooting Stars!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Smoke?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI'm using a Breath Dial.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.45,0:09:09.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't notice the smell because of the\Nrotten eggs.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.66,0:09:17.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now you're completely surrounded by\Ngas.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.77,0:09:18.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gas?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.47,0:09:20.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.27,0:09:25.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flame Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.15,0:09:38.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That one's gonna sting!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.85,0:09:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Usopp!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.21,0:09:59.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NI am Usopp...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.14,0:10:00.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Leader of the invincible\Nnation of pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.10,0:10:03.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,who reign over this island!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.57,0:10:05.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You stand before\Na living legend,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.00,0:10:08.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,the most revered\Npirate who ever lived!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.10,0:10:10.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the great Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.21,0:10:20.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHahahahahah!\NThat's pretty cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.58,0:10:23.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth,\Nor I'll shut it for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.34,0:10:24.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHow come?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.88,0:10:27.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We're friends, right? So get on.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHey! I see an island!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.34,0:10:37.24,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAwesome! I can't\Nwait to check it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.27,0:10:42.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right, let's go!\NMerry, full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.50,0:10:44.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NFull speed ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.65,0:11:17.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.25,0:11:20.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.58,0:11:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm no fool.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.65,0:11:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I realize it'll take more than that to\Nbeat you.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.76,0:11:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.81,0:11:49.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fight every battle with all your\Nstrength.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.62,0:11:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm ready for any technique you've\Ngot!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.66,0:11:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special Attack...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.96,0:12:01.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Gatling!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.70,0:12:02.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Blasting...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Cactus Stars!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.31,0:12:16.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Triple Exploding Stars!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.89,0:12:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.43,0:12:42.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to put an end to this!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.24,0:12:58.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Recognize this?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.80,0:13:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}I bet that bazooka would've\Nhurt. Let's find out!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.88,0:13:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:10.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Waaaaaah!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.85,0:13:14.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He used an Impact Dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Auuuugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.16,0:13:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.99,0:13:54.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I am Usopp, Leader of the\Ninvincible nation of pirates
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.90,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,who reign over this island!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.29,0:14:05.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NCheers to a new\Nship and a new crewmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.27,0:14:09.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cheers]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.21,0:14:12.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSo? How do you like this one?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.19,0:14:14.53,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah! Keep it! That's the one!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.74,0:14:16.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! It's all done!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.10,0:14:17.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Now the Going Merry
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.00,0:14:21.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,has everything she\Ncould possibly need!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.42,0:14:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[LUFFY]\NGum-Gum Bullet!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.70,0:14:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.42,0:15:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least it's over now.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.18,0:15:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou idiot.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.41,0:15:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You knew it would end like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.89,0:15:32.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You knew you could never beat me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.24,0:16:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhy did this have to happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.81,0:16:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDo whatever you\Nwant with the Merry.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.14,0:16:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let anything\Nhold us back.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.08,0:16:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're getting a new ship\Nand sailing forward.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.38,0:16:26.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me sit up there!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.32,0:16:29.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry Usopp, but this seat's\Nreserved for the captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.25,0:16:33.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! What're you making?\NLemme see, lemme see!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.19,0:16:35.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on, the Usopp\NFactory is off limits
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.22,0:16:37.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,'til I finish this for Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.49,0:16:51.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NGuys, listen up!\NI will go to Elbaf someday!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.49,0:16:53.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,To the village of warriors!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:53.66,0:16:57.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah! Great!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.33,0:17:01.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIt's the festival on\Nthe night before gold hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.01,0:17:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NSo long, Usopp.\NIt was fun while it lasted.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NChopper! Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.06,0:17:26.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.93,0:17:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was already hurt before the fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.07,0:17:31.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I don't help him,\Nwho knows what'll happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.40,0:17:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHe isn't part\Nof our crew anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.17,0:17:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSo what?! I'm a doctor!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.77,0:17:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's my job to treat him!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.06,0:17:45.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough\Nthat he lost the duel;
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.62,0:17:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if you pity him\Nat a time like this,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.25,0:17:52.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll end up hurting him\Nmore than any of those injuries.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.42,0:17:54.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NI'm sure you\Nhave good intentions.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.34,0:17:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But all we can do now is\Ngive him dignity in defeat.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.29,0:18:01.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He knew that when he\Nchallenged Luffy to a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.23,0:18:03.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this is how it might end.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.37,0:18:16.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too much.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.35,0:18:19.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to be captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.46,0:18:25.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't doubt yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.17,0:18:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In times like these if\Nyou lose your confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then who can we\Nhave faith in?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's pack our things and go.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.56,0:18:59.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou know as well\Nas me that after tonight
Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.13,0:19:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can never return\Nto this ship again.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
